1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,100
Say you need a hotel.

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,333
You just ask.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,133
It has its own private computer.

4
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:11,667
It searches, compares,

5
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:13,700
and finds the booking page.

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:18,700
Before it spends a single euro, it asks you.

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:22,133
Approve once, always allow, or say no.

8
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,233
It remembers how you like things.

9
00:00:26,233 --> 00:00:27,833
So next time, just say:

10
00:00:27,833 --> 00:00:29,067
book the usual.

11
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,833
Use it in the chat apps you already use,

12
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:35,433
or on your laptop, browser and phone.

13
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,067
Give it jobs before bed.

14
00:00:38,067 --> 00:00:40,000
It works through them overnight,

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,900
and tells you in the morning.

16
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,300
Profiles each have a job.

17
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,800
Ada does errands,

18
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,800
Milo watches money, Juno writes.

19
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:54,133
You set the limit, and see every step.

20
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,833
New skills weekly.

21
00:00:56,833 --> 00:00:58,367
Nothing breaks.

22
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,533
Headmaster.

23
00:01:00,533 --> 00:01:03,367
Your own agent, always on.
